.TH "GYRO" "1" "Nov 2026" "Gyro Hosting" "gyro manual"

.SH NAME
gyro-server-app-retry - Retry a failed or silent app install (rebuilds the disk; confirm required; 3 per server per hour)


.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBgyro server app retry  [flags]\fP


.SH DESCRIPTION
Retry a failed or silent app install (rebuilds the disk; confirm required; 3 per server per hour)

.PP
Allowed when the latest install has \fBstatus\fR hata (failed) or \fBstuck\fR = true (no news for too long). On cloud servers the server is rebuilt with the same app, OS and domain; ALL data on the disk is deleted.

.PP
API: POST /cloud/servers/{id}/app/retry (operationId retryAppInstall, scope cloud_write)


.SH OPTIONS
\fB--data\fP=""
	request body as JSON, @file or @- (stdin)

.PP
\fB--dry-run\fP[=false]
	show the price quote / request without changing anything

.PP
\fB-h\fP, \fB--help\fP[=false]
	help for retry

.PP
\fB--idempotency-key\fP=""
	idempotency key (automatic for money operations)

.PP
\fB--set\fP=[]
	extra body field key=value (repeatable)

.PP
\fB--wait\fP[=false]
	wait until the server is no longer busy

.PP
\fB--wait-timeout\fP=15m0s
	maximum time for --wait


